WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Create a private AI assistant with a name and clear custom instructions.

00:06.000 --> 00:18.000
Open the assistant, add your Knowledge file, and wait for processing to finish.

00:18.000 --> 00:30.000
Select the file this version may use, then save instructions and models.

00:30.000 --> 00:43.000
Open a conversation, choose AI Assistant in the tools menu, and select your assistant.

00:43.000 --> 00:49.000
Ask a question. Relevant Knowledge excerpts are used as reference material.
